an {  font-family: 宋体;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_7 {  font-weight: bold;}span.docx_8 {  color: #0000FF;  text-decoration: underline;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_9 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Calibri;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_10 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Calibri;}p.docx_11 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_11 span {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}p.docx_11 span {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}span.docx_12 {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}span.docx_12 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_12 {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}p.docx_13 {  border-top: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_13 span {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}p.docx_13 span {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}span.docx_14 {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}span.docx_14 p {  border-top: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_14 {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}p.docx_15 {  text-indent: 21.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_15 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_16 {  text-indent: 21.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_16 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_17 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 24pt); text-indent: 24pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（通讯员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">丁思琪</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月25日下午，学校2026年本科教学督导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">工作会议</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在长安校区会议中心104会议室召开。会议邀请西安交通大学柯大钢教授作报告，第十一届本科教学督导组成员出席，会议由本科生院教务处副处长李亚汉主持。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 21pt); text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 411.75pt; height: 269.1pt;"><img src="/__local/D/DE/65/12674D83D0FC8ECD098DD5BD5AE_AA48CA33_17019.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/DDE6512674D83D0FC8ECD098DD5BD5AE/AA48CA33/17019" vheight=" 269.1pt" vwidth=" 411.75pt" orisrc="/__local/0/42/77/9205F9DBC81E77FB0CF1989B4CF_358F3ED7_11EE2.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 411.75pt; height: 269.1pt;"></span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 24pt); text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">柯大钢教授系统介绍了西安交通大学校院两级督导工作的组织架构与运行机制，围绕听课巡课、试卷及毕业环节检查、教学事故认定等具体职责，重点分享了课堂听课的经验做法。他强调，要关注青年教师课堂效果，注重及时反馈交流，强化持续跟踪跟进，切实发挥督导在教学质量保障中的促进作用。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 24pt); text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">会上，李亚汉同志通报了2026年本科教学重点工作，督导工作应重点听评平台课程及专业核心课程的教学质量，加</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">强</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">对</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">教授授课的督查；注重遴选优良课程案例，分享推广和推荐优质奖；鼓励督导积极参加业务交流与研讨，持续提升履职能力。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 24pt); text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">在交流研讨环节，督导组成员围绕线上线下听课实效、课程组共性问题的反馈路径、青年教师课堂教学检查的制度安排、督导在专业建设与调整中的角色定位等议题展开深入讨论，进一步明晰了工作方向。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: calc(100% + 24pt); text-indent: 24.1pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本次会议聚焦质量主题，凝聚共识，明确任务，为推动本科教学高质量发展提供了有力支撑。</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
